  "name": "Jerked Chicken Mango Salsa",
  "text": "Jerked Chicken Mango Salsa\n\nPreparation time: 5 minutes\n\nWaiting time: 1 hour\n\nYield: 1 medium bowl\n\nIngredients\n\n2 tbsp brown sugar\n\n3 tbsp freshly squeezed lime juice\n\n1/2 tsp hot sauce\n\n1 tbsp minced ginger\n\n1 mango, diced\n\n1 English cucumber, diced\n\n2 spring onions, diced\n\nPepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1. in a medium bowl, combine the sugar, lime juice, hot sauce and ginger. Mix thoroughly and then add the remaining ingredients. Toss and refrigerate for 1 hour.",
